00:13:43.518 --> 00:13:46.054
Leave it in the comments, I
will join in the discussion.

00:13:46.054 --> 00:13:48.154
Finally, want to give a quick
shout out to Paul Bungard.

00:13:48.154 --> 00:13:49.767
Paul, thank you so much
for buying my book,

00:13:49.767 --> 00:13:51.220
